cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "gnomAD-population-af-analysis"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: MacDermott
    given-names: Aine
    affiliation: University of Richmond

repository-code: "https://github.com/yourusername/gnomAD-population-af-analysis"

keywords:
  - population genetics
  - allele frequency
  - gnomAD
  - polygenic risk
  - genomics
  - ancestry

abstract: >
  A short pipeline for scraping gnomAD allele counts, aggregating subpopulations into 
  custom population groupings, performing per-variant statistical testing against reference 
  populations, and calculating cumulative polygenic divergence metrics (with optional beta-weighted modeling).

license: MIT
